#: ../../source/janim/anims_core/display.rst:2
msgid "display"
msgstr "display"

#: janim.anims_core.display.DisplayType:1 of
msgid "用于类型检查和 ``isinstance`` 判断的基类"
msgstr "The base class used for type checking and ``isinstance`` checks"

#: janim.anims_core.display.Display:1 of
msgid "用于标记物件在特定时间区段中的数据"
msgstr "Used to mark the data of an item in a specific time-range"

#: janim.anims_core.display.Display:3 of
msgid "作为 :meth:`~.AnimStack.display` 的产物，表示“物件从一个特定时间开始，被更改为了这样的数据”"
msgstr ""
"As the result of :meth:`~.AnimStack.display`, it indicates that \"the item has been changed to this data starting from a "
"specific time\""

#: janim.anims_core.display.Display:5 of
msgid "另见：:meth:`~.Timeline.detect_changes_of_all`"
msgstr "See also: :meth:`~.Timeline.detect_changes_of_all`"

#: janim.anims_core.display.Display.apply:1 of
msgid "给 ``params`` 初始化物件数据"
msgstr "Initializes item data for ``params``"

#: janim.anims_core.display.Display.apply:3 of
msgid "将 ``self.data`` 重置为 ``self.data_orig`` 的数据并设置到 ``params.data`` 上，避免原始数据被意外更改"
msgstr ""
"Resets ``self.data`` to the data of ``self.data_orig`` and sets it to ``params.data`` to prevent the original data from "
"being accidentally modified"

#: janim.anims_core.display.Display.apply:5 of
msgid "特殊情况："
msgstr "Special case:"

#: janim.anims_core.display.Display.apply:7 of
msgid ""
"当 :class:`~.AnimStack` 的动画堆栈只有一个动画，即该类型动画时，不会经由该方法， 而是直接被其访问 ``data_orig``，起到一点"
"点优化的作用"
msgstr ""
"When the animation stack of :class:`~.AnimStack` contains only one animation, which is this type of animation, this "
"method is skipped and ``data_orig`` is accessed directly, providing a small optimization"

#: janim.anims_core.display.DelayedDisplay:1 of
msgid "和 :class:`Display` 基本一样，但是会在时间轴全局时刻到达 ``.t_range.at`` 后才调用 ``func`` 函数设置 ``data`` 状态"
msgstr ""
"Basically the same as :class:`Display`, but it only calls the ``func`` function to set the ``data`` state after the "
"global timeline time reaches ``.t_range.at``"

#: ../../source/janim/anims_core/display.rst
msgid "参数"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: janim.anims_core.display.DelayedDisplay:3 of
msgid "状态挂载给哪个物件"
msgstr "The item to which the state is applied"

#: janim.anims_core.display.DelayedDisplay:4 of
msgid "当全局时刻到达 ``.t_range.at`` 后的回调函数，需要返回一个 :class:`~.Item` 作为物件状态"
msgstr ""
"The callback function invoked after the global time reaches ``.t_range.at``. It must return an :class:`~.Item` as the "
"item state"

#: janim.anims_core.display.DelayedDisplay.apply:1 of
msgid "具体请参考 :class:`StackableAnimation` 以及 :class:`ApplyParams` 的介绍"
msgstr "For details, see the descriptions of :class:`StackableAnimation` and :class:`ApplyParams`"

#: janim.anims_core.display.DoBecomeAtEnd:1 of
msgid "对 :class:`DelayedDisplay` 针对各个动画 ``become_at_end`` 参数实现的封装"
msgstr "A wrapper around :class:`DelayedDisplay` that implements the ``become_at_end`` parameter for each animation"

#: janim.anims_core.display.DoBecomeAtEnd:3 of
msgid ""
"即注册到 ``end~FOREVER`` 时段，将 ``end`` 时刻前计算出的动画状态作为显示状态； 并在 ``is_latest_display=True`` 时自"
"动 :meth:`~.Item.restore`"
msgstr ""
"That is, it is registered for the ``end~FOREVER`` interval and uses the animation state calculated before the ``end`` "
"time as the display state; it also automatically calls :meth:`~.Item.restore` when ``is_latest_display=True``"

#~ msgid "返回记录的物件数据"
#~ msgstr "Returns the recorded item data"
